Historical games compiled to run on ZXCPM (at 6100h)
See also here:   https://github.com/z88dk/techdocs/tree/master/targets/zx/zxcpm

ADVEN-80 and ADV48K are complementary to the files in the "standard" ALTCPM sections.
It is possible to use M80 and L80 directly on a ZX Spectrum to build the games !
